# The ZED 2i exposes separate USB 3 video and USB 2 HID devices. Jetson's
# default two-second USB autosuspend can suspend the camera between discovery
# and stream startup, producing UVC status -71 and CAMERA STREAM FAILED TO
# START. Keep only Stereolabs devices awake.
ACTION=="add", SUBSYSTEM=="usb", ATTR{idVendor}=="2b03", TEST=="power/control", ATTR{power/control}="on"
